From 77f45e2b0b7442fe989fb2e4fc9bb97ccc33fc33 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ajaykumar <a.nerurmuthukrishnan@shell.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 17:49:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make OpenCascade (occt-wasm) available in the desktop build

- aakar-occt.mjs: import the occt-wasm facade (index.js / OcctKernel) before the
  raw Emscripten factory (occt-wasm.js); loading the factory first produced a
  kernel without makeBox/fuse/... and "OpenCascade not available"
- workflow: replace the esbuild route (tools/build-occt.mjs wiped app/occt) with
  scripts/fetch-occt-wasm.js + the 13-check self-test gate on app/occt/aakar-occt.mjs;
  on failure only the runtime files are removed, never the committed binding
- package.json: pin occt-wasm 5.7.1 as a devDependency (npm ci installs it),
  `npm run occt` = fetch + self-test; app/occt/package.json marks ES modules for Node 20
- .gitignore: keep the downloaded runtime out of git; drop the stale root build-windows.yml
- tests: regression test for the facade-vs-factory mix-up (13 passed)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MvLybUGZkdXhnZxC5CmdGQ
